poc/data/clean-acceptance-2026-11-09/judge/reader-A-3.log:3771:22:ev-11 Nvidia said on its fiscal Q2 2027 analyst call that systems based on its Vera Rubin architecture had already been delivered commercially to customers during August 2026. LINKS [('clean-5', "Will Nvidia's Vera Rubin platform, the next-generation system now in production and receiving purchase orders from hyperscalers, account for about 20% of the data center segment's revenue in fiscal Q3 2027, as management guided?")]
poc/data/clean-acceptance-2026-11-09/judge/reader-A-3.log:4059:22:ev-11 Nvidia said on its fiscal Q2 2027 analyst call that systems based on its Vera Rubin architecture had already been delivered commercially to customers during August 2026. LINKS [('clean-5', "Will Nvidia's Vera Rubin platform, the next-generation system now in production and receiving purchase orders from hyperscalers, account for about 20% of the data center segment's revenue in fiscal Q3 2027, as management guided?")]
