 reports the current supply and capacity commitments that the question tracks."}]},{"item":"13:e9","matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#9","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[{"thesis":"clean-3","judgement":"right","why":"It reports the current guarantee amount and the OpenAI project guarantee."}]},{"item":"13:e10","matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#3","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[]},{"item":"13:e11","matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#7","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[{"thesis":"clean-4","judgement":"right","why":"Cloud revenue growth provides evidence of demand and potential returns that can influence hyperscalers' infrastructure spending."}]}],"matters":[{"matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#1","status":"kept","item":"13:e1","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#2","status":"kept","item":"13:e2","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#3","status":"kept","item":"13:e10","note":"The item also retains valuation multiples, which D385 excludes."},{"matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#4","status":"kept","item":"13:e4","note":"Orders are separately recorded in 13:e5."},{"matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#5","status":"kept","item":"13:e6","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#6","status":"kept","item":"13:e7","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#7","status":"kept","item":"13:e11","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#8","status":"kept","item":"13:e8","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#9","status":"kept","item":"13:e9","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:8653711909bcf63268b8735b#10","status":"kept","item":"13:e3","note":""}],"theses":[{"thesis":"clean-5","judgement":"wrong","class":"not_a_reason","against":null,"why":"A quarterly revenue share is a company financial measure, not a product node or another permitted reason to open a thesis."}]},{"article":14,"items":[{"item":"14:e1","matter":null,"verdict":"optional","row":"§5.3 known facts retold: past actual","links":[]},{"item":"14:e2","matter":"gnews:954c0e42ee45f4cc13e3132e#1","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[]},{"item":"14:e3","matter":"gnews:954c0e42ee45f4cc13e3132e#2","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[{"thesis":"clean-1","judgement":"right","why":"A sustained memory shortage can affect the cost and terms of Nvidia's memory procurement commitments."}]},{"item":"14:e4","matter":null,"verdict":"noise","row":"§5.3 other companies' actions and figures without a demonstrated path to a Nvidia question","links":[{"thesis":"clean-1","judgement":"wrong","why":"Micron's overall revenue growth estimates do not establish Nvidia's supplier commitments."}]},{"item":"14:e5","matter":null,"verdict":"noise","row":"§5.3 journalist's background and framing","links":[{"thesis":"clean-1","judgement":"wrong","why":"The generic description of tight memory supply does not establish the amount of Nvidia's commitments."}]},{"item":"14:e6","matter":"gnews:954c0e42ee45f4cc13e3132e#3","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[]},{"item":"14:e7","matter":"gnews:954c0e42ee45f4cc13e3132e#3","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[]}],"matters":[{"matter":"gnews:954c0e42ee45f4cc13e3132e#1","status":"kept","item":"14:e2","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:954c0e42ee45f4cc13e3132e#2","status":"kept","item":"14:e3","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:954c0e42ee45f4cc13e3132e#3","status":"kept","item":"14:e6","note":"The contracted-power increase is separately recorded in 14:e7."}],"theses":[]},{"article":15,"items":[{"item":"15:e1","matter":"gnews:a88be8fcf16633fb32dd5c3b#1","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[]}],"matters":[{"matter":"gnews:a88be8fcf16633fb32dd5c3b#1","status":"kept","item":"15:e1","note":""}],"theses":[]},{"article":16,"items":[],"matters":[],"theses":[]},{"article":17,"items":[],"matters":[],"theses":[]},{"article":18,"items":[{"item":"18:e1","matter":"gnews:6d2b29d8e482817e9d9b617b#1","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[]},{"item":"18:e2","matter":null,"verdict":"optional","row":"§5.3 known facts retold: past actual","links":[]},{"item":"18:e3","matter":"gnews:6d2b29d8e482817e9d9b617b#2","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[]}],"matters":[{"matter":"gnews:6d2b29d8e482817e9d9b617b#1","status":"kept","item":"18:e1","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:6d2b29d8e482817e9d9b617b#2","status":"kept","item":"18:e3","note":""}],"theses":[]},{"article":19,"items":[{"item":"19:ev-guidance-70","matter":"gnews:7dfc742ee60ef2c0380501ca#1","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[]},{"item":"19:ev-fq2-results","matter":null,"verdict":"optional","row":"§5.3 known facts retold: past actual","links":[{"thesis":"clean-5","judgement":"wrong","why":"Total data-center revenue in the preceding quarter does not show Rubin's share of the following quarter's revenue."}]},{"item":"19:ev-memory-constraint","matter":"gnews:7dfc742ee60ef2c0380501ca#1","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[{"thesis":"clean-1","judgement":"right","why":"A memory supply constraint can influence Nvidia's efforts and commitments to secure supply."},{"thesis":"clean-6","judgement":"wrong","why":"The statement identifies a memory shortage but does not identify server DRAM or support the specific price projection."}]},{"item":"19:ev-supply-commitments","matter":"gnews:7dfc742ee60ef2c0380501ca#3","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[{"thesis":"clean-1","judgement":"right","why":"It directly reports the current supplier commitments and their increase."},{"thesis":"clean-6","judgement":"wrong","why":"The article does not establish how much of Nvidia's memory procurement is server DRAM or its effect on that price."}]},{"item":"19:ev-dram-prices","matter":"gnews:7dfc742ee60ef2c0380501ca#2","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[{"thesis":"clean-1","judgement":"right","why":"Higher memory prices and shortages can increase the cost of securing the memory behind supplier commitments."},{"thesis":"clean-6","judgement":"right","why":"It directly states the server DRAM price projection and prior increase."}]},{"item":"19:ev-equity-gains","matter":"gnews:7dfc742ee60ef2c0380501ca#5","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[]},{"item":"19:ev-china-access","matter":"gnews:7dfc742ee60ef2c0380501ca#1","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[]},{"item":"19:ev-analyst-pushback","matter":"gnews:7dfc742ee60ef2c0380501ca#1","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[]}],"matters":[{"matter":"gnews:7dfc742ee60ef2c0380501ca#1","status":"kept","item":"19:ev-guidance-70","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:7dfc742ee60ef2c0380501ca#2","status":"kept","item":"19:ev-dram-prices","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:7dfc742ee60ef2c0380501ca#3","status":"kept","item":"19:ev-supply-commitments","note":""},{"matter":"gnews:7dfc742ee60ef2c0380501ca#4","status":"kept","item":"19:ev-supply-commitments","note":"The $145 billion spending claim appears in the same item as the commitments."},{"matter":"gnews:7dfc742ee60ef2c0380501ca#5","status":"kept","item":"19:ev-equity-gains","note":""}],"theses":[{"thesis":"clean-6","judgement":"ok","class":null,"against":null,"why":"Server DRAM pricing is a checkable shared price that can affect several companies and Nvidia's costs."}]},{"article":20,"items":[{"item":"20:ev-1","matter":"gnews:243636e860a787a59c4d0c7a#1","verdict":null,"row":null,"links":[{"thesis":"clean-2","judgement":"right","why":"It reports the announcement and size of the acquisition whose completion the thesis tracks."}]}],"matters":[{"matter":"gnews:243636e860a787a59c4d0c7a#1","status":"kept","item":"20:ev-1","note":""}],"theses":[]}]}
