reports/step2-score-council-2026-11-08/codex-review-2.stderr:287:For example, the harness can reconstruct the original candidate list for X22 and check that every displayed score belongs to the right search query and stored statement. Whether that reconstruction passes is a **before-send check**, not something that must be proved before writing the harness.
